    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12960" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-κρουστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to drive off, dispel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.116
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.396
				</span></i>
			; <i>repulsive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>waning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σελήνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					149
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Al.
				<u>G.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλτος ἀ. πρὸς σελήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.2241
				</span></i>
			.</div>
